+# both functions mutate ``conv_state`` / ``prev_hs_state`` in place and return
+# ``(qk_out, v2_input)`` -- the conv output ``[T, in_out_ch]`` and the (shifted)
+# ``val_proj2`` input ``[T, hidden_size]``.
